@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M18 — Observed operation result is separate from subject state
state "Intended operation\nrequested" as Requested
state "Denied before prohibited\neffect" as Denied
state "Eligible / pending outcome" as Pending
state "Required result confirmed" as Confirmed
state "Definite failed result" as Failed
state "Confirmed partial result" as Partial
state "Actual result unknown" as Unknown
[*] --> Requested : scoped initial context
Requested --> Denied : SM-T119 request denied\n[not permitted]
Requested --> Pending : SM-T120 eligible request accepted\n[eligible accepted request]
Pending --> Confirmed : SM-T121 result confirmed\n[required actual result]
Pending --> Failed : SM-T122 failure established\n[definite failure]
Pending --> Partial : SM-T123 partial result established\n[partial evidence]
Pending --> Unknown : SM-T124 confirmation lost\n[unconfirmed effect]
Unknown --> Confirmed : SM-T125 effect reconciled\n[matching actual result]
Unknown --> Failed : SM-T126 effect reconciled\n[definite failed disposition]
Unknown --> Partial : SM-T127 effect reconciled\n[partial effects known]
Unknown --> Pending : SM-T128 progress reconciled\n[same operation still pending]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
